13520161,2025-05-15,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"To : TransUnion XXXX XXXX. XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX, PA XXXX Experian XXXX. XXXX XXXX XXXX, TX XXXX Subject : Formal Dispute and Identity Theft Complaint Regarding Account XXXX XXXX Dear TransUnion and Experian, I am writing to formally dispute the continued reporting of an account listed as XXXX XXXX on my credit report. I have previously disputed this account and clearly stated that it is the result of identity theft, fraud, and misrepresentation. Despite my prior notification and submission of supporting documentation, no appropriate action has been taken. This account continues to appear on my credit report in clear violation of federal law. 

